        "slc_fb2a8649986f4b064b235781417d5285ba494cf6561aeb137388b64b7241bbf5"
      ],
      "text": "The product is a terminal-based orchestrator wrapping Claude, Codex, and Gemini CLIs with automatic failover and a shared knowledge base, advertised at roughly $60/month in subscriptions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8dd44c98b08cf31c8704b1fd2da600583c0b6cd5b2819d5284a8a43c534db94e",
