        "slc_4d33656699cb8ada7208891b6a4c723d3fda755c728bdef987b601e43bc93ae6"
      ],
      "text": "Messages are routed through ordered role chains; when an agent fails or is down, the next agent in the chain is tried, and if all fail an error with recovery options is shown."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a4b59dd6e0551a6b8c13b58ba849cc03e392dc1d209b40c54a42b216781bc46e",
